gt;&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;OUR DEI&amp;amp;B COMMITMENT&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:160,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:259}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;We hire talented people from a variety of backgrounds and experiences and are committed to a work environment based on diversity, open-mindedness and curiosity. We’re united by our company values (we even created them together!) and we celebrate our unique differences.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:160,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:259}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;Our employee lifecycle processes are designed to embrace equal opportunity and prevent discrimination against our people regardless of personal characteristics. It is our strong belief that the more inclusive and belonging we are as a business, the better our work will be.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:160,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:259}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;As an inclusive employer, we guarantee to interview all neurodiverse and physically disabled applicants who meet the minimum criteria for this role. We also encourage candidates to notify us of any reasonable adjustments that may be required during the recruitment process. This includes providing job adverts in alternative, accessible formats or adjustments required at interview stage.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:160,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:259}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;If you consider yourself to be neurodiverse or physically disabled under the UN definition of disability and would like to be considered under this scheme and/or require any reasonable adjustments please let us know by sending an email to &lt;/span&gt;&lt;a ----- ----- data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt; clearly stating your consent for us to process this data. &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;For more information please refer to our &lt;/span&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.form3.tech/legal/recruitment-data-policy&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;Recruitment Data Policy&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:160,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:259}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.co.uk">Jobs in United Kingdom</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Hi 👋 we’re Genio. We create beautifully simple learning tools that boost knowledge, skills, and confidence.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;We’re a SaaS scale up - there’s 90+ of us around the UK with our HQ in Leeds.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Our software is award-winning and used by 100,000s of students at over 1,000 universities &amp;amp; colleges worldwide.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;We’re driven achieve our mission to support 1 million students to become better learners by 2030.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;🚀 About the role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Career track:&lt;/strong&gt; IC4&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Unit:&lt;/strong&gt; Shared Services&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Genio has given everyone access to Claude, but most of what makes AI work across a company doesn’t exist here yet: connections to our business systems, a shared skills library, people in each team who can help their colleagues, and the checks that keep it safe. This role designs and builds that system, then gets every team using it.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;It’s a hands-on building role. We buy and configure leading platforms rather than build our own agent infrastructure, and you’ll write code and build custom integrations wherever configuration isn’t enough. Success is measured by how well other teams build and run their own workflows.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;You will be responsible for:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Design.&lt;/strong&gt; You design how our AI platforms, connectors, skills and agents fit together. You track what’s changing in AI tools, recommend platform and model choices to the Head of BizOps, and judge new tools on measured performance, reliability, security and cost.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Build and run.&lt;/strong&gt; You build and maintain the integrations and agents that connect our AI platforms to business systems such as our CRM and our documentation, communication and finance tools. You’re responsible for the health of the whole system: spotting failures and out-of-date skills, and tracking use and cost by team so they can be recharged and reported. Champions answer first-line questions and IT handles access, while you handle escalations and fix root causes so problems don’t come back.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Knowledge.&lt;/strong&gt; You build and look after the skills library and the shared knowledge our AI tools draw on: where it lives, how it’s organised, and how it’s kept current and correctly permissioned. You spot good workflows in one team, refine them and make them available to everyone, and decide which become company standards. The teams that own content keep it up to date.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Adoption.&lt;/strong&gt; You train people at every level of technical skill and build a network of champions, nominated by their function heads, so every team has someone nearby to ask. You work alongside teams as they redesign processes, bringing the options for what can be automated, and share practice with engineering in both directions. You also report, team by team, where use is growing, where it’s slow and which uses are producing value.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Guardrails.&lt;/strong&gt; You keep the inventory of AI tools and what each can access, run a fast track for low-risk trials using criteria from our AI policy, and coordinate security, data protection and legal reviews for everything else. Every trial starts with agreed success criteria and ends with a decision to adopt, scale or stop. You configure and check guardrails, such as human review before AI output reaches customers or students, and limits on what agents can do on Genio’s behalf.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;👥 Meet the team&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You will be reporting directly into the Head of BizOps (Business Operations) and working most closely with:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Division leaders and SME champions&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Platform Ops and the Principal Engineers&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Head of EX (Employee Experience), on how roles and expectations change&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;VP Finance, on cost and recharging&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;IT and InfoSec, RevOps and Data in BizOps&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Legal and data protection&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;👤 About you&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Essential:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Professional experience rolling out AI tools or automation that teams other than your own use day to day, including redesigning the processes around them.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hands-on experience connecting systems through APIs and automation platforms such as Zapier, Make or n8n, and enough Python or JavaScript to write, read and debug integrations, with AI assistance.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A track record of teaching technical things to non-technical people, and a way of knowing it worked.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Examples of persuading senior people when you disagreed with their priorities, and of setting your own direction against a wider goal.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Sound judgement about data and access, including knowing when a connection needs a security review before it goes live.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Desirable:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;HubSpot administration or development&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Organising shared knowledge, such as documentation or knowledge bases&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Setting up or running a champions or super-user network&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience in education or with sensitive personal data&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;An engineering background&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;💰 Salary and benefits&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;p&gt;£70,000 - £85,000 dependent upon experience&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;🏖️ 33 days annual leave (Inclusive of bank holidays)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;🎄 3 gifted days off at Christmas&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;💰 EMI Share Options Scheme&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;🎓 Generous individual learning and training allowance&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;⌚ Truly flexible hours to suit when you work best&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;💻 Full home working set up and beautiful collaborative office space&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;🚗 Free Leeds City Centre office parking&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;🌴 Nomad working policy with family travel insurance&lt;/li&gt;
