&lt;p&gt;Thank you for considering Oklo. We are hiring a Senior Director, International Affairs to join our Strategy team.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Position Description&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Oklo is seeking a Senior Director of International Affairs to develop international opportunities that can materially advance the company&#39;s long-term strategy. This role connects market choices, senior relationships, sovereign and government capital, industrial partnerships, and selected cross-border initiatives.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You will help determine where Oklo should engage, which institutions matter, and what a credible partnership or investment proposition should look like. The scope extends across the company&#39;s businesses and strategic priorities, rather than being limited to individual international reactor deployment projects.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You will report to the Chief of Strategy Officer and work directly with the CSO on assigned initiatives. You will coordinate closely with the CFO organization, Government Affairs, Legal, technical and regulatory leaders, and business-unit teams, with explicit agreement on market coverage, counterpart relationships, and execution responsibilities.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This person must reside in either the United Kingdom or the Netherlands.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Specific responsibilities may include:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Target markets and partnerships. &lt;/strong&gt;Develop recommendations on priority markets, institutions, and opportunities based on strategic fit, partner capabilities, commercial demand, capital availability, timing, and risk.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Sovereign and institutional relationships. &lt;/strong&gt;Build and advance relationships with sovereign investors, government institutions, industrial partners, and other organizations relevant to Oklo&#39;s global strategy.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Structure international opportunities. &lt;/strong&gt;Develop business cases and proposed structures for international partnerships, sovereign or government-capital opportunities, joint ventures, and other cross-border initiatives.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Advance transactions. &lt;/strong&gt;Work with Finance, Business Development, Corporate Development, Strategic Partnerships, and Legal to test economics, assess counterparties, develop terms, and advance approved opportunities toward executable agreements.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Navigate regulatory and policy dependencies. &lt;/strong&gt;Coordinate with Government Affairs and technical, regulatory, and legal specialists on political, policy, licensing, export, and other dependencies that affect an opportunity&#39;s feasibility.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Lead initiative execution. &lt;/strong&gt;Lead assigned initiatives across internal teams and outside advisers, maintaining clear objectives, owners, milestones, and decisions through launch or handoff.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Prepare and represent leadership. &lt;/strong&gt;Prepare senior leadership for important international engagements and represent Oklo when delegated; work with the Strategy Associate on research, analysis, and materials and the Strategy Manager on coordinated follow-through.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Align cross-functional stakeholders. &lt;/strong&gt;Align engagement plans with existing international and business-unit owners, avoid conflicting commitments, and recommend where to advance, defer, or decline an opportunity.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Minimum Qualifications:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience in international business, strategic investing, government, industrial partnerships, or a related field, with evidence of delivering outcomes across institutions and jurisdictions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrated ability to develop substantive relationships with senior government, commercial, or financial counterparties and translate engagement into concrete opportunities&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong commercial and financial judgment, including the ability to evaluate partnership economics, business cases, and potential capital structures.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience leading cross-functional work while drawing on appropriate technical, legal, policy, and financial expertise.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent writing and cross-cultural communication, sound discretion, and the ability to make practical recommendations from incomplete information.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Must reside in the UK or the Netherlands.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Bonus Qualifications:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with sovereign investors, development finance, government-backed capital, or cross-border industrial ventures.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Exposure to nuclear energy, the fuel cycle, infrastructure, advanced technology, or other strategically important industries.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience connecting government and commercial objectives; relevant regional expertise or additional language capabilities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Competencies&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are looking for a Senior Director, International Affairs that is:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Able to connect geopolitical and institutional context to specific commercial choices&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Able to build durable trust while maintaining clear objectives and realistic commitments&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Able to work effectively across cultures, disciplines, and organizations with different incentives&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Can distinguish meaningful strategic progress from access, visibility, or meeting volume&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Passionate about clean energy&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Passionate about making advanced fission a reality&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Willing and able to learn quickly&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Highly strategic and a forward-looking thinker&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;An entrepreneurial mindset with comfort operating in ambiguity&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;An exceptional communicator, negotiator, and has relationship-building skills&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Contains a strong executive presence and cross-functional leadership ability&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Aware of global perspectives with awareness of geopolitical and macroeconomic trends&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Passionate for building transformational infrastructure businesses&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Eager to work on a dynamic team, receive constructive feedback, and grow with us&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Willing to think differently and do things in new ways&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Comfortable in a fast-paced, highly iterative startup environment&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excited to think creatively, critically, and reflectively about the problems they are solving, while not leaning only on what has been done before&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Willing to propose novel and creative solutions to technical problems&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;An excellent writer who can write in modern active voice, so make your cover letter compelling and write it well!&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Able to communicate technical content and results verbally&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Who you are:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;A startup person&lt;/span&gt;: You aren&#39;t driven by titles or hierarchy, and prefer efficiency to excess process. You don&#39;t need or expect to have a lot of guidance but you enjoy working in a fast-paced team. If you prefer the culture and feel of a large organization, that is great, but you likely won’t enjoy working with us! There is plenty of important work and plenty of good opportunities with organizations like that.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;u&gt;Motivated&lt;/u&gt;: You are self-motivated. You bring an enthusiasm to the team, and imbue a sense of passion that goes beyond clocking in and clocking out. This isn’t about a fake or arbitrary “pieces of flair” mentality or lack of work-life balance! It is about being a part of the vision and feeling a part of reaching team goals.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;u&gt;A team-player&lt;/u&gt;: Oklo genuinely is a team. We aren’t about taking credit for ourselves, and we aren’t about pushing blame to others. We do incredible things because we work as a team.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;u&gt;An excellent communicator&lt;/u&gt;: We need a person who is not only technically competent but also a clear and upbeat communicator.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;u&gt;Creative&lt;/u&gt;: Being creative means that when things fall outside clear scopes or processes or problems arise without clear solutions, you are able to identify it as well as invent ways to solve a problem or fill a need without micromanagement. The successful person in this job will not only be creative, but also enjoy being creative and solving open-ended problems which may change day-by-day.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;u&gt;Detail-oriented&lt;/u&gt;: This focus is a big part of excellence, consistency, and quality. Excellent grammar and spelling matter for both good communication as well as the image of the company that we put forward.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About Oklo compensation:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Salary: $250,000-$290,000&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Oklo offers flexible time off, equity, bonuses, competitive pay, 401(k), health insurance (with employer contribution), HSA, FSA, flexible work hours, wellness credits, and other benefits.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;hr&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About Oklo Inc.:&lt;/strong&gt; Oklo Inc. is developing fast fission power plants to deliver clean, reliable, and affordable energy at scale; establishing a domestic supply chain for critical radioisotopes; and advancing nuclear fuel recycling to convert nuclear waste into clean energy. Oklo was the first to receive a site use permit from the U.S. Department of Energy for a commercial advanced fission plant, was awarded fuel material from Idaho National Laboratory, and submitted the first custom combined license application for an advanced reactor to the U.S. Nuclear Regulatory Commission. Oklo is also developing advanced fuel recycling technologies in collaboration with the U.S. Department of Energy and U.S. National Laboratories.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong data-stringify-type=&quot;bold&quot;&gt;#CHOP: Oklo’s Values&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong data-stringify-type=&quot;bold&quot;&gt;Collaboration&lt;/strong&gt;: We go further, together. We bring diverse perspectives, listen actively, and build trust through transparency and respect. We work across disciplines, sharing ownership to turn complex challenges into shared successes.&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong data-stringify-type=&quot;bold&quot;&gt;Humility&lt;/strong&gt;: We are team players who act for the good of the company and for the world. We are focused on our mission, not personal recognition.&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong data-stringify-type=&quot;bold&quot;&gt;Ownership&lt;/strong&gt;: We take pride in what we do and how we do it. We are proactive in finding solutions and see tasks through&amp;nbsp; to completion. We are committed to delivering on our promises to provide clean, reliable, and affordable energy.&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong data-stringify-type=&quot;bold&quot;&gt;Pathfinding&lt;/strong&gt;: We chart new ground where no path exists by approaching challenges with curiosity, courage, and creativity while navigating ambiguity.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Candidates should be aware that employment may be contingent upon successful completion of a drug screening, and employees may be subject to drug testing at any time in accordance with company policy and applicable laws.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3 data-start=&quot;82&quot; data-end=&quot;118&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;86&quot; data-end=&quot;118&quot;&gt;Recruitment Fraud Disclaimer&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;120&quot; data-end=&quot;326&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Oklo is aware of recent recruitment fraud attempts targeting job seekers. Please be cautious of anyone claiming to represent Oklo who does &lt;strong data-start=&quot;259&quot; data-end=&quot;266&quot;&gt;not&lt;/strong&gt; contact you from an official Oklo email address.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;328&quot; data-end=&quot;613&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;All legitimate communications from our recruiting team— including application updates, interview requests, and job offers — will come &lt;strong data-start=&quot;462&quot; data-end=&quot;477&quot;&gt;exclusively&lt;/strong&gt; from an &lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: ----- email. Oklo will never ask for sensitive personal information, payments, or account credentials during the hiring process.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;615&quot; data-end=&quot;807&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;If you receive suspicious outreach or have concerns about the authenticity of any communication claiming to be from Oklo, please contact us through the official channels listed on our website.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.co.uk">Jobs in United Kingdom</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;p&gt;Airtable helps organizations build the applications and workflows they need to run their most important business processes, without being constrained by off-the-shelf software. Its flexible platform combines a relational database, custom applications, automations, and AI, giving teams the building blocks to create solutions around the way they actually work. Just like Lego blocks, what our customers can build with Airtable is virtually limitless.&amp;nbsp; That flexibility is why more than 500,000 organizations, including 80% of the Fortune 100, use Airtable to power critical work across their businesses.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As a Solutions Consultant, you’ll leverage your professional tenure, robust business acumen, and in-depth technical expertise to guide prospective customers through their Airtable evaluation and expansion. You will partner across lines of business as you lead the technical evaluation and compel decision-makers to choose Airtable as their critical operational workflow management tool.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Solutions Consulting Mission Statement&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our mission is to fundamentally improve our customers’ quality of life by empowering organizations and the individuals that drive them to reimagine the way they operate, collaborate, and innovate in Airtable. We sit at the confluence of Sales, Services, Product, and Marketing and take a customer-centric approach to creating value through intentful listening, storytelling, expert guidance, tailored solutions, and applying a highly consultative process. We foster a culture of collaboration, creativity, and excellence through continuous improvement and professionalism. We strive to be the trusted partner that drives success and growth for every project, every team, and every individual we serve.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you&#39;ll do&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborate with Pre Sales teams to identify, qualify and drive revenue opportunities at Enterprise accounts - net new and install motions&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build meaningful relationships with and serve as a trusted advisor to a prospect or customer’s technical teams&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own the technical evaluation process showcasing customer-centric value within the context of the customer&#39;s unique requirements, workflows, and business process needs&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Translate the value of Airtable’s tooling into the language of the customer&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Manage multiple sales cycles simultaneously, proactively communicating with stakeholders and prioritizing effectively&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Consult with credibility, bringing a well-rounded and unique perspective with hands-on cross-functional experience—i.e., direct experience in marketing, program/project management, consulting, operations, etc.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Inform the product team and ultimately the product roadmap with meaningful market potential findings&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Represent Airtable in every engagement with the utmost care&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Who you are&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;An experienced customer-centric professional with a well-balanced skillset spanning business acumen, technical knowledge, and effective communication skills&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience managing sales cycles and owning the technical evaluation&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Working knowledge of Marketing, Product Operations, Retail MGMT, and other Business Units&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Understands best practices for structuring data in a relational database and database architecture&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Passionate about creating unique solutions for complex business problems&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Loves the spotlight - adaptable and compelling communicator and presenter, easily matches the language of the room, author and storyteller&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Technically savvy, demonstrating a deep understanding of enterprise integration methodologies, best practices and API architecture&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Low code no code application experience throughout the customer life cycle&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Travel as needed - seasonality peaks at 40-50%&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Must Have: French or German speaking&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Airtable is an equal opportunity employer. We embrace diversity and strive to create a workplace where everyone has an equal opportunity to thrive. We welcome people of different backgrounds, experiences, abilities, and perspectives. All qualified applicants will receive consideration for employment without regard to race, color, religion, sex, sexual orientation, gender identity, national origin, disability, protected veteran status or any characteristic protected by applicable federal and state laws, regulations and ordinances. Learn more about your &lt;a href=&quot;https://drive.google.com/file/d/1jAj2by1bto5g8Xqn9hWNAwPOMGNd_fM6/view?usp=sharing&quot;&gt;EEO rights as an applicant&lt;/a&gt;&lt;strong&gt;.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;VEVRAA-Federal Contractor&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;If you have a medical condition, disability, or religious belief/practice which inhibits your ability to participate in any part of the application or interview process, please complete our &lt;a href=&quot;https://airtable.com/appwNpUUGOyO4KSne/shrBRUNVfrEIXsAZI&quot;&gt;Accommodations Request Form&lt;/a&gt; and let us know how we may assist you. Airtable is committed to participating in the interactive process and providing reasonable accommodations to qualified applicants.&lt;/p&gt;<p>Find <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.co.uk">Jobs in United Kingdom</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About WPP Media&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;WPP is the trusted growth partner for the world’s leading brands. With exceptional talent, trusted data and intelligence, and world-class partnerships – all united by our pioneering agentic marketing platform, WPP Open – we help clients navigate change, capture opportunity, and deliver transformational growth. &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;WPP Media is WPP&#39;s AI-driven media operating unit, bringing together media, data, and partnerships to deliver creative personalisation at scale. Connected through WPP Open and powered by Open Intelligence, clients see exactly where, how, and why their media investment is working.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;For more information, visit &lt;a href=&quot;wppmedia.com&quot;&gt;wppmedia.com&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;3490 - Senior Associate, SEO&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Role Summary and Impact&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;u&gt;Openmind:&lt;/u&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Openmind, part of WPP, is an integrated agency model drawing on talent from across WPP. It has been created to accelerate the European transformation for Nestlé’s media function. Core to the solution is the advanced best data and technology capabilities, fuelled by WPP’s investment in AI, to maximise the impact of Nestlé media investment.&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are looking for a highly motivated SEO Exec to join our award-winning and rapidly growing SEO team, to support SEO Account Managers in the day-to-day running of their SEO campaigns for some of EssencemediaCom biggest clients. This is a great opportunity for someone who is ready to take more ownership and progress their SEO career.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Not only will the successful candidate be working with some of the largest brands and advertisers in the world, they will also have the opportunity to develop their knowledge of media planning, thanks to the close integration between Essencemediacom SEO team with other specialist departments within the company.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Skills and Experience&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At WPP Media, we believe in the power of our culture and our people. It’s what elevates us to deliver exceptional experiences for both our clients and each other. In this role it will be critical to embrace WPP &amp;amp; WPP Media’s shared core values:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Be &lt;strong&gt;Extraordinary&lt;/strong&gt; by &lt;em&gt;Leading Collectively&lt;/em&gt; to &lt;em&gt;Inspire transformational Creativity.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Create an &lt;strong&gt;Open&lt;/strong&gt; environment by&lt;em&gt; Balancing People and Client Experiences&lt;/em&gt; by &lt;em&gt;Cultivating Trust&lt;/em&gt;.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead &lt;strong&gt;Optimistically&lt;/strong&gt; by &lt;em&gt;Championing Growth&lt;/em&gt; &lt;em&gt;and Development&lt;/em&gt; to &lt;em&gt;Mobilize the Enterprise&lt;/em&gt;.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A demonstrable passion for digital marketing and associated technologies&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Good knowledge of Excel&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to juggle a number of tasks at once and consistently to deliver high-quality work to timescale&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A high degree of numeracy and literacy are essential (analytical thinking)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience using SEO tools highly beneficial - Google Analytics, Keyword Planner, Advanced Web Rankings, Omniture, SEMRush etc.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent project management and problem-solving skills&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to pre-empt problems and be pro-active in producing solutions&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Life at WPP Media &amp;amp; Benefits&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our passion for shaping the next era of media is powered by our commitment to Be Extraordinary, investing in our employees to inspire transformational creativity. We also Lead Optimistically,&amp;nbsp;firmly believing&amp;nbsp;in and Championing Growth and Development for every individual. This commitment allows WPP Media employees to&amp;nbsp;leverage&amp;nbsp;the extensive global WPP Media &amp;amp; WPP networks to pursue their passions, build vital professional connections, and learn at the&amp;nbsp;cutting edge&amp;nbsp;of marketing and advertising.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We Create an Open environment built on trust and respect, where everyone feels they belong and has opportunities to progress. This inclusive culture is fostered through a variety of employee resource groups and frequent in-office events&amp;nbsp;showcasing&amp;nbsp;team wins, sharing thought leadership, and celebrating holidays and milestone events. Our comprehensive benefits package reflects this commitment, including competitive medical, group retirement plans, vision, and dental insurance, significant paid time off, preferential partner discounts, and employee mental health awareness days.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;WPP Media is an equal opportunity employer and considers applicants for all positions without discrimination or regard to characteristics. We believe the best work happens when we&#39;re together, fostering creativity, collaboration, and connection in this open and supportive environment. That&#39;s why we’ve adopted a hybrid approach, with teams in the office around four days a week. If you require accommodations or flexibility, please discuss this with the hiring team during the interview process.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Please read our Privacy Notice (&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.wppmedia.com/pages/privacy-policy&quot;&gt;https://www.wppmedia.com/pages/privacy-policy&lt;/a&gt;) for more information on how we process the information you provide.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;While we appreciate all applications received, only those candidates selected for an interview will be contacted.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;#LI-Promoted&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;TextRun SCXW227196529 BCX8&quot; lang=&quot;EN-CA&quot; data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW227196529 BCX8&quot;&gt;Please read our &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.wppmedia.com/pages/privacy-policy#:~:text=WPP%20Media%20Privacy%20Notice%20for%20Recruitment&quot;&gt;Privacy Notice&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;TextRun SCXW227196529 BCX8&quot; lang=&quot;EN-CA&quot; data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW227196529 BCX8&quot;&gt;for more information on how we process the information you provide.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;EOP SCXW227196529 BCX8&quot; data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:276}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.co.uk/english-speaking-jobs">English Speaking Jobs in United Kingdom</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About WPP Media&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;WPP is the trusted growth partner for the world’s leading brands. With exceptional talent, trusted data and intelligence, and world-class partnerships – all united by our pioneering agentic marketing platform, WPP Open – we help clients navigate change, capture opportunity, and deliver transformational growth. &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;WPP Media is WPP&#39;s AI-driven media operating unit, bringing together media, data, and partnerships to deliver creative personalisation at scale. Connected through WPP Open and powered by Open Intelligence, clients see exactly where, how, and why their media investment is working.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;For more information, visit &lt;a href=&quot;wppmedia.com&quot;&gt;wppmedia.com&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;3941 - Project Management Director - UK&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Google via Media Futures Group - A little about us:&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Media Futures Group (&lt;strong&gt;MFG&lt;/strong&gt;)&amp;nbsp;is a bespoke team within WPP dedicated to driving AI-enabled marketing transformation for Google, serving as a full strategic growth partner. Powered by the WPP network, we operate seamlessly across media, creative, and data to elevate industry standards and deliver at the scale and speed of Google.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our team is made up of best-in-class experts who thrive on curiosity and innovation. We are committed to fostering a workforce that enables every individual to develop multiple areas of deep expertise with broad, future-ready skills to thrive in an AI-driven, agentic future. We are fully invested in your whole-person wellbeing and the tools needed to do the best work of your career. This is a team empowered by limitless possibilities.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As part of a larger project management practice group, you will work closely with media &amp;nbsp;SMEs to help drive transformative projects focused on continuous improvement and optimization.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This critical role will act as a facilitator and collaborator across workstreams, specialists, and client stakeholders to translate desired outcomes and scope into activities and plans to deliver the required outputs. &amp;nbsp; This person will also play a key role in defining impacts of projects on day-to-day campaign lifecycle and effective storytelling on value &amp;amp; impact of project outcomes across different audiences.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This role is currently focused on partnering with functional SMEs across the team to define and drive a portfolio of Media Standards &amp;amp; Best Practices projects. These projects focus on defining frameworks / playbooks, understanding process impacts, designing change management strategies / content, and defining governance / monitoring processes to ensure adoption. This group sits at the intersection of global and regional stakeholders, ensuring that we deliver global consistency while identifying regional &amp;amp; local nuances to strengthen adoption to all campaign work we deliver.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The PM Director may also lean into project workstreams that underpin the MFG Partnership Strategy and Plan.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;They will also ensure that the challenge and requirements are understood by the team and will participate in the processes needed to incorporate project outputs. They are able to ensure all project deliverables are aligning to overarching client business objectives and roadmap. They are able to understand how this project links, impacts and has dependencies across other projects and priorities within the MFG media delivery framework.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This role must be comfortable wearing multiple hats including project manager, strategic thinker, process designer, change agent and consultative problem solver with a proven track record of driving results.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This role must be comfortable creating order from ambiguity and driving results across a range of internal and external stakeholders.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Skills and Experience&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Project &amp;amp; Program Management / Process Design / Change Management
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hands-on, roll-your-sleeves up, can-do leader who’s comfortable setting the vision, getting into the details, and able to connect the dots&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Quintessential project and program planner who can plot the course from start to finish, anticipate and plan for risks, seamlessly shift between the strategic and tactical, and course correct as needed&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience in project management / engagement delivery experience ideally within &amp;nbsp;in a consulting or agency organization&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong analytical and problem solving skills&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong process documentation, design and optimization skills working in conjunction with functional experts and practitioners&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong level change management skills - understands various change management approaches / methodologies, able to create change strategy, identify audiences and personas, create / curate required artifacts, drive and track adoption / impact.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Communications and collaboration
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Comfortable having tough conversations with key stakeholders (internal and external)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent written / verbal communication and storytelling skills including ability to tailor messages based on audience&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Adept at conflict resolution and driving through conflicting priorities across diverse stakeholder groups&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Fosters an environment of inclusive collaboration&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lifelong learner / innovator / early adopter mindset
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Adept at learning new technologies&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proactive problem identifier and solver&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Embraces the opportunity to identify ways to leverage AI, automation and technology solutions to improve processes, drive efficiency and quality&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develops a deep understanding of Google’s business&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Comfortable with ambiguity and breaking down complex problems into simple solutions&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;Life at WPP Media &amp;amp; Benefits&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;Our passion for shaping the next era of media is powered by our commitment to&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;Be Extraordinary, investing in our employees to inspire transformational creativity. We also&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;Lead Optimistically, firmly believing in and&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;Championing Growth and Development&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;for every individual. This commitment allows WPP Media employees to leverage the extensive global WPP Media &amp;amp; WPP networks to pursue their passions, build vital professional connections, and learn at the cutting edge of marketing and advertising.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
