&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;French native, fluent in English; German language skills preferred. Experience across the French market.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
