&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Comfort operating in an early-stage environment with ambiguity, high ownership and regular regional travel.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Excellent collaboration skills across marketing, sales, and cross-functional partners.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
