&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The work you’ll do:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Identify &amp;amp; Frame Value&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Discover and translate customers’ strategic priorities into high-impact Celonis use cases&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build demos and business cases, leveraging industry benchmarks and best practices in order to win new customers&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Undertake Value Assessments or Proof-of-Value Projects and communicate the value opportunity and strategic roadmap to C-Level executive&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Realize Value&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Facilitate business value workshops and use Celonis to identify and qualify opportunities for process enhancement&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Derive improvement measures in core business functions and initiate improvement actions and enterprise-wide change initiatives&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Present results and realized value to senior management and C-level executives&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Scale Value&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Responsible for the end-to-end customer value journey, landing, expanding, adoption and renewing&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build a strategic expansion roadmap for customers embedding Celonis Process Intelligence as a strategic business transformation platform in their organization and therefore drive adoption and expansion&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Provide feedback to our product development teams to enhance the Celonis platform and Apps based on new use cases&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The qualifications you need:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Live for Customer Value: &lt;/strong&gt;Experience in an analytical role with the objective to demonstrate or secure value through business data analysis, business process improvement and respective Software deployment. Ideally in a customer-facing role in Solution Consulting, Sales Engineering or IT/Management Consulting with a Business Software / SaaS Provider or a Consultancy. Alternatively in an Inhouse role (e.g. Center of Excellence for Data Mining / Analytics / Intelligence) within an Enterprise.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Data, Analytics, Applications &amp;amp; IT: &lt;/strong&gt;Good knowledge of Business Software / SaaS applications (e.g. SAP),&amp;nbsp; experience with implementing RPA and/or BI Tools and/or building Dashboards, Apps and Action Flows. Knowledge of &lt;strong&gt;Python&lt;/strong&gt; and/or SQL. Experience in collaborating with IT teams.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Process Improvement &amp;amp; Value Realization: &lt;/strong&gt;Experience in identifying use cases for business process improvement and deploying improvement measures,&amp;nbsp; being a change agent and training users/process owners to realize value&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Project Management: &lt;/strong&gt;Experience in planning and managing project scopes, expectations and timelines. You will manage multiple projects across your aligned accounts that will be at different parts of the value journey. Also, you will leverage partners from the Celonis Ecosystem wherever possible.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Executive Stakeholder Management: &lt;/strong&gt;Experience in preparing and communicating (value) roadmaps and results to stakeholders and management, both internally and externally. Excellent communication and presentation skills.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Business Domain Expertise: &lt;/strong&gt;Understanding of the Finance and/or Supply Chain domain as well as strategic transformation initiatives (e.g. Shared Services Transformation or System Transformation)&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Industry Expertise: &lt;/strong&gt;Ideally expertise in Aviation/Logistics/Transportation and the ability to develop a deep understanding of industry trends and strategic opportunities&amp;nbsp; &lt;strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Degree: &lt;/strong&gt;In Technology &amp;amp; Management, Industrial/Business Engineering, Business Informatics, Computer Science, Mathematics, Economics or a comparable degree program&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What Celonis can offer you:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul class=&quot;p-rich_text_list p-rich_text_list__bullet p-rich_text_list--nested&quot; data-stringify-type=&quot;unordered-list&quot; data-list-tree=&quot;true&quot; data-indent=&quot;0&quot; data-border=&quot;0&quot;&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;Pioneer Innovation:&lt;/span&gt; Work with the global leader in Process Mining and the Process Intelligence Graph to shape the future of AI-driven business operations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;Ownership from Day 1:&lt;/span&gt; Every full-time &quot;Celonaut&quot; is an owner, receiving Restricted Stock Units (RSUs) and merit-based refresh grants.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;Unrivaled Family Support:&lt;/span&gt; Benefit from our inclusive parental leave policy—24 weeks of fully paid leave for primary carers and 12 weeks for supporting carers, available from your first day of employment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;Work-Life Integration:&lt;/span&gt; Enjoy Unlimited PTO (in applicable regions) and generous PTO globally, as well as a flexible hybrid work model that balances remote focus with vibrant office collaboration.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;Continuous Growth:&lt;/span&gt; Elevate your skills through our 70-20-10 learning framework, mentorship programs, and access to a dedicated learning platform.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;Holistic Well-being:&lt;/span&gt; Prioritize your health with subsidized Wellhub memberships, mental health counseling, and dedicated &quot;Wellness Weeks&quot; that prioritize work/life balance.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;Drive Sustainability:&lt;/span&gt; Participate in annual Impact Days, where you receive paid time off to volunteer for community and environmental causes with your local office, or virtually.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;Global Inclusion &amp;amp; Belonging:&lt;/span&gt; Find community through our Inclusion Think Tank and participate in our annual Inclusion Days, ensuring every voice is heard and valued.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;Value-Driven Impact:&lt;/span&gt; Join a mission-led organization where our core values—Live for Customer Value, The Best Team Wins, We Own It, and Earth Is Our Future—drive every decision.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About Us:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;1264&quot;&gt;Celonis is the trusted platform to industrialize Enterprise AI, empowering organizations to analyze, design, and operate AI-driven processes. The Celonis Platform is powered by the Celonis Context Model, which combines process data, business knowledge, and intelligence to create a living digital twin of the enterprise that AI can understand — turning AI’s operational blind spots into operational clarity. Industry-leading companies around the world trust Celonis and its global ecosystem of partners to make their AI agents, people, systems, and processes work together, achieving transformational outcomes. Celonis is headquartered in Munich, Germany, and New York City, USA, with more than 20 offices worldwide.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;1982&quot;&gt;Get familiar with the Celonis Process Intelligence Platform by watching this &lt;a class=&quot;_ymio1r31 _ypr0glyw _zcxs1o36 _mizu194a _1ah3dkaa _ra3xnqa1 _128mdkaa _1cvmnqa1 _4davt94y _4bfu18uv _1hms8stv _ajmmnqa1 _vchhusvi _kqswh2mm _ect4ttxp _2rkolb4i _syaz13af _1a3b18uv _4fpr8stv _5goinqa1 _f8pj13af _9oik18uv _1bnxglyw _jf4cnqa1 _30l313af _1nrm18uv _c2waglyw _1iohnqa1 _9h8h12zz _10531ra0 _1ien1ra0 _n0fx1ra0 _1vhv17z1&quot; href=&quot;https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=YR5oRJGhJYg&amp;amp;list=PLuVor-ZUD4pnM6G33C5D0tjXUvlTPYBRe&quot; data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot; data-is-router-link=&quot;false&quot; data-testid=&quot;link-with-safety&quot;&gt;video&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Celonis Inclusion Statement:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At Celonis, we believe our people make us who we are and that “The Best Team Wins”. We know that the best teams are made up of people who bring different perspectives to the table. And when everyone feels included, able to speak up and knows their voice is heard - that&#39;s when creativity and innovation happen.&lt;strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Your Privacy:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Any information you submit to Celonis as part of your application will be processed in accordance with Celonis’ &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.celonis.com/careers/candidate-notices&quot;&gt;Accessibility and Candidate Notices&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;By submitting this application, you confirm that you agree to the storing and processing of your personal data by Celonis as described in our &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.celonis.com/careers/privacy-notice/&quot;&gt;Privacy Notice for the Application and Hiring Process&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Use of Artificial Intelligence Tools&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;We rely on an artificial intelligence tool to match the information from your resume to the relevant Celonis job descriptions. This processing is limited to the information provided in your resume or in your candidate profile. The tool produces a match score per candidate for a role, suggests preliminary ranking, and provides recommendations.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;The tool is only used for support in parts of the job application process, including to facilitate the identification of the relevant Celonis Jobs for candidates and recruiters. All final decisions are made by hiring managers and the Celonis talent acquisition team. Hiring managers and HR specialists use this tool responsibly, are aware of the risk of potential bias, and are equipped to mitigate it.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Please be aware of common job offer scams, impersonators and frauds. Learn more &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.celonis.com/careers/fraud-alert/&quot;&gt;here&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.fr">Jobs in France</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the team:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-pm-slice=&quot;1 1 []&quot;&gt;As an iOS Engineer on the Design System team, you&#39;ll translate SumUp&#39;s design language into a reusable, easy-to-use library of UI components and experience patterns, empowering product teams to build cohesive, accessible user experiences at scale.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The Design System team works hand-in-hand with the Mobile Platform team to set standards and provide guidance across all product teams at SumUp. As we expand our ecosystem of merchant and consumer-facing products, this role offers a rare opportunity to shape the foundation that helps developers build faster and ship higher-quality experiences to millions of users worldwide.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you’ll do:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Shape the core experience for both users and developers interacting with SumUp&#39;s iOS ecosystem&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborate closely with product and design teams to build components that are maintainable, consistent, and beautiful&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Embed accessibility best practices into every component — from content descriptions and touch target sizing to color contrast and dynamic type&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Provide hands-on technical guidance to product teams to deliver on company priorities, including the upcoming support for landscape orientation&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Review code contributions, enforce design system conventions, and mentor engineers on best practices for reusable UI development&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead the migration of legacy UIKit-based components to SwiftUI while maintaining system stability&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proactively identify and address technical debt to uphold a high bar for engineering excellence and codebase health&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;You’ll be a great fit for this role if you:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Bring 3+ years of professional iOS development experience, ideally on large-scale or consumer-facing applications&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Are fluent in Swift, with deep hands-on knowledge of both SwiftUI and UIKit — and a clear view on when and how to use each&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Bring experience building or contributing to a design system, component library, or shared UI framework, and understand what it takes to make components truly reusable and scalable&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Take pride in crafting accessible user experiences — you know your way around VoiceOver, dynamic type, color contrast, and touch target standards, and treat accessibility as a first-class concern, not an afterthought&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Bring a strong grasp of testing best practices for UI components, including unit tests, snapshot tests, and UI automation&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Are comfortable reviewing code and mentoring peers — you enjoy sharing knowledge, giving constructive feedback, and raising the bar for the whole team&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Are self-motivated and structured in your working style — you manage your own priorities, communicate clearly in English, and thrive in a cross-functional, collaborative environment&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Stay genuinely curious about the iOS ecosystem — you follow Apple&#39;s releases closely, experiment with new APIs, and are excited to bring fresh ideas back to the team&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Why you should join SumUp:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;🌎 Opportunity to work with a truly global, multicultural team from our Paris location. This involves an office-first setup&lt;br&gt;🌈 Commitment to Diversity and Inclusion: be part of a workplace that values and promotes diversity, fostering an inclusive environment where everyone&#39;s perspectives are respected and embraced&lt;br&gt;🚀 Enrolment onto our Virtual Stock Option programme: you will own a stake in SumUp&#39;s future success&lt;br&gt;📚 A dedicated annual L&amp;amp;D budget of €2000 for your individual development, which can be used to attend conferences and/or advance your career through further education&lt;br&gt;💼 Financial security: corporate pension contributions that support your long-term future&lt;br&gt;🏥 Healthcare support: we cover 50% of the monthly cost of your health insurance for your Mutuelle and Prévoyance&lt;br&gt;🚌 Extra allowances: we offer restaurant tickets (Swile) and cover transportation costs&lt;br&gt;🌴 Break4me: 1-month sabbatical after 3 years of service&lt;br&gt;🔗 Referral Bonus: earn additional rewards by referring talented individuals to join the SumUp team&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About SumUp&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We believe in the everyday hero.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Small business owners are at the heart of all we do, so we&#39;re creating tools that help them run their businesses. With a founder’s mentality and a &#39;team-first’ attitude, our diverse teams across Europe, South America and the United States work together to ensure that the small business owners we partner with can be successful doing what they love.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;SumUp is an Equal Employment Opportunity employer that proudly pursues and hires a diverse workforce. SumUp does not make hiring or employment decisions on the basis of race, colour, religion or religious belief, ethnic or national origin, nationality, sex, gender, gender identity, sexual orientation, disability, age or any other basis protected by applicable laws or prohibited by company policy. SumUp also strives for a healthy and safe workplace and strictly prohibits harassment of any kind.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;SumUp will not accept unsolicited resumes from any source other than directly from a candidate&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Job Application Tip&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;We recognise that candidates feel they need to meet 100% of the job criteria in order to apply for a job. Please note that this is only a guide. If you don’t tick every box, it’s ok too because it means you have room to learn and develop your career at SumUp.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.fr">Jobs in France</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;En bref&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;div&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal leading-[1.7]&quot;&gt;Tu as envie de contribuer à la révolution des supermarchés ? Chez Picnic, tu as l&#39;opportunité de rejoindre une jeune équipe créative et bouillonnante, dans une culture start-up, où tout ce que tu fais compte. Grâce à une approche basée sur les données (data-driven) et un service unique, Picnic se bat pour faire des courses quelque chose de simple, drôle et accessible à tous. En outre, nous travaillons dans la perspective d&#39;un avenir plus durable en utilisant des technologies de pointe et en exploitant une flotte de véhicules de livraison 100 % électriques.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal leading-[1.7]&quot;&gt;En 2021, Picnic a levé 600 millions d&#39;euros auprès de la Fondation Bill &amp;amp; Melinda Gates afin de se développer en Europe. Après avoir lancé avec succès les opérations en Allemagne et dans le Nord de la France, nous poursuivons maintenant notre expansion en France en nous développant notamment en région parisienne.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Tes missions&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;div&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal leading-[1.7]&quot;&gt;Basé.e au bureau de Paris, tu feras partie de l&#39;équipe juridique et travailleras avec le directeur juridique France, en étroite coopération avec l&#39;équipe des Pays-Bas et les équipes opérationnelles en France. Concrètement, tes missions seront principalement :&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;
&lt;ul class=&quot;[li_&amp;amp;]:mb-0 [li_&amp;amp;]:mt-1 [li_&amp;amp;]:gap-1 [&amp;amp;:not(:last-child)_ul]:pb-1 [&amp;amp;:not(:last-child)_ol]:pb-1 list-disc flex flex-col gap-1 pl-8 mb-3&quot;&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot;&gt;Contrats commerciaux : gestion des contrats quotidiens (les revoir et commenter, les négocier avec l&#39;aide d&#39;un responsable juridique, et les suivre jusqu&#39;à la signature) ;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot;&gt;Baux commerciaux : revoir les lettres d&#39;offres et travailler sur les premiers drafts des baux, assurer le suivi du process jusqu&#39;à la signature ;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot;&gt;Être le premier interlocuteur des équipes opérationnelles, notamment des équipes commerciales, safety et infrastructure, pour toutes leurs questions juridiques ;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot;&gt;Assister l&#39;équipe juridique sur les projets de long-terme (pré-contentieux/contentieux) et les négociations de contrats complexes ; et&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot;&gt;Gestion du secrétariat juridique et des formations (augmentations de capital, approbation des comptes, gestion des pages permettant la formation des opérationnels, etc.).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;À propos de toi&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot;&gt;Élève-avocat.e (PPI) ou Master 2 en droit avec une connaissance générale du droit français des affaires (droit privé, contrats, consommation, distribution, immobilier, etc.)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot;&gt;Tu es vif.ve, dynamique, autonome et rigoureux.se, tu as l&#39;esprit d&#39;équipe et es force de propositions&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot;&gt;Anglais professionnel, qui te permet de suivre des réunions, de communiquer et de lire et écrire parfaitement (l&#39;anglais est la langue de travail de Picnic)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot;&gt;Tu cherches un stage à partir de janvier 2027&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot;&gt;Tu vis déjà ou as la possibilité de te relocaliser à Paris&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;Avantages Picnic&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal leading-[1.7]&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;Tout expert a un jour été débutant !&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt; Tu auras de nombreuses occasions de te mettre au défi et de t&#39;épanouir, notamment grâce aux sessions Lunch &amp;amp; Learn et à la formation sur mesure en compétences non techniques. Nous proposons également des cours de langue professionnels hebdomadaires gratuits.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal leading-[1.7]&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;Fais la différence.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt; Tu travailleras dans un environnement stimulant, avec la liberté de mener tes propres projets et de créer un impact direct et visible.&amp;nbsp;Grâce à nos véhicules entièrement électriques et à notre modèle économique durable, tu contribueras également à rendre le monde meilleur !&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal leading-[1.7]&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;Le travail d&#39;équipe nous fait avancer !&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt; Avec plus de 80 nationalités réparties dans 3 pays, tu feras partie d&#39;une entreprise diversifiée qui offre de nombreuses occasions de s&#39;investir, qu&#39;il s&#39;agisse de soirées à thème, d&#39;apéritifs entre collègues ou de nos séjours annuels au ski, etc.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal leading-[1.7]&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;Reste en bonne santé.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt; La santé mentale est importante. En plus de la possibilité de parler avec des collègues qui agissent en tant que conseiller(ère)s confidentiel(le)s, notre collaboration avec OpenUp te donne un accès facile et gratuit à des psychologues professionnels, ainsi qu&#39;à des ateliers et des outils pratiques.&amp;nbsp;Il existe de nombreuses communautés et événements sportifs auxquels tu peux participer, du tennis au yoga en passant par l&#39;escalade !&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal leading-[1.7]&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;Équilibre entre vie professionnelle et vie privée.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt; Dans la mesure du possible, nous souhaitons te permettre de travailler selon des modalités adaptées à ton style de travail, ce qui explique notre modèle de travail hybride. Nos équipes aiment généralement avoir au moins un jour en équipe par semaine au bureau, mais à part cela, c&#39;est toi et ton équipe qui décidez.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal leading-[1.7]&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Notre offre :&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/em&gt; Pour ce stage de 6 mois, nous offrons un salaire brut de 1500,00 € par mois.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
